 Config

╭ Config ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│Project: project                                                                                            │
│Storage: SQLite output and instance check artifacts. k: usage and cleanup · b: build caches · R: resource   │
│limits.                                                                                                     │
│Preferences: saved per project and instance.                                                                │
│                                                                                                            │
│Mouse: Enabled                                                                                              │
│Run mode: Continue queue                                                                                    │
│Planner approval: Automatic                                                                                 │
│Delivery: local via origin/main                                                                             │
│Dependencies: manual external setup; Current Task and Configuration offer r Recheck when a prerequisite is  │
│missing. CLI require declares prerequisites before a task starts.                                           │
│                                                                                                            │
│Defaults apply to new tasks; existing revisions stay pinned.                                                │
│u User defaults: what new projects start with; preview and apply them here.                                 │
│f Profiles: named role models to reuse; select one here or as the new-project default.                      │
│w Work categories: templates that tell AI turns how to execute, review, validate and remediate code,        │
│documents or art; override per project.                                                                     │
│L Review lenses: opt-in specialist reviews (concurrency, security, simplicity or your own) and the project's│
│default selection.                                                                                          │
╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
